  "description": "<p>By request, I upload one common mod. I probably won’t delete the reflex mods. I’ll leave them as a showcase. In the future, I will simply supplement this mod with new reflex sight.</p>\n<p>reflex:</p>\n<p>Axion Kobra EKP-8-02|8-18</p>\n<p>Fast Fire</p>\n<p>EOTech HHS-1 hybrid sight/tan ver</p>\n<p>Pilad p1x42</p>\n<p>okp-7 (picatini straps)</p>\n<p>Walther MRS</p>\n<p>Aimpoint “Micro H-2”</p>\n<p>Valday Krechet reflex sight</p>\n<p>SIG Sauer ROMEO8T reflex sight</p>\n<p>ELCAN Specter HCO holographic sight</p>\n<p>All marks showcase - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/XSH6dh2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/XSH6dh2</a></p>\n<p>And of course, thank you <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/30096-boogle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Boogle</a> for allowing me to use his mod “Old PK-06 Restoration” as the basis, without him this collection would not exist</p>\n",
